[-] marvelous		<-->	a++[0]	./ˈmɑːvələs/-NAmE /ˈmɑːrvələs/ (US English marvelous) [IE-B1-Z04-L-01]
	;tuyệt vời, kỳ diệu -- (1) extremely good; wonderful
		;synonym fantastic, splendid
		;This will be a marvellous opportunity for her.
		;The weather was marvellous.
		;It is marvellous what, how, etc… It's marvellous what modern technology can do.
		;Extra Examples:
		;This is really marvellous news!
		;The food smells absolutely marvellous.
				;Oxford Collocations Dictionary
				;verbs
				;befeellook…
				;adverb
				;reallyabsolutelyquite…
		;See full entry
		;Word Origin
